name: ['Blightning', 'Cryptic Command', 'Feral Hydra', 'Flame Javelin', 'Lightning Bolt', 'Nameless Inversion', 'Negate', 'Rampaging Baloths', 'Rampant Growth', 'Remove Soul', 'Spellbreaker Behemoth', 'Terminate', 'Unmake']
